-- Mercimek çorbası  (slug: mercimek-corbasi)
-- BLOCKED — no row is written.
-- Portion measure exists but composition does not. TÜBER Ek 2.1.5 publishes 'Çorba çeşitleri
-- (tahıl, kuru baklagil, sebze vb.) = ¾ kupa veya 1.5 orta kepçe veya 180 mL veya 1 küçük kase'
-- (footnote 10: this equals ½ standard portion) — a volume, with no gram weight and no
-- per-portion nutrient row in Ek 2.3.1. TürKomp only has the dry powder 'Kuru Çorba Karışımı,
